      "id": "prop-one-step",
      "label": "Proposition 4",
      "line": 110,
      "proofDependencies": [],
      "section": "construction",
      "statement": "\\label{prop:one-step}\nLet $v=Hg$, $\\delta=g^THg$, $w=Av$, $\\beta=v^TAv$, and\n$\\gamma=w^THw$.  The step in \\eqref{eq:abstract-step} satisfies\n\\begin{align}\ng_+&=g-\\tau\\frac{\\delta}{\\beta}w,\n\\label{eq:one-step-g}\\\\\nH_+&=H-\\frac{Hww^TH}{\\gamma}+\\frac{vv^T}{\\beta}.\n\\label{eq:one-step-H}\n\\end{align}\nIn particular, the matrix update is independent of $\\tau$, and every\ndenominator in \\eqref{eq:one-step-g}--\\eqref{eq:one-step-H} is positive.",
      "statementDependencies": [],
      "title": "Exact formulas for one DFP step",
      "type": "Proposition",
      "paperMapping": "Separate declarations prove the gradient formula, matrix formula, parameter independence, and denominator positivity.",
      "texLabel": "prop:one-step",
